                },
                "question": "<p>每轮把搜索范围缩小一半，二分查找的时间复杂度是？</p>",
                "answers": [
                  {
                    "text": "<p>O(n²)</p>",
                    "correct": false,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "最多经过对数数量的折半，搜索区间就会缩小至一个元素。",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<p>O(n)</p>",
                    "correct": false,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "最多经过对数数量的折半，搜索区间就会缩小至一个元素。",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<p>O(log n)</p>",
                    "correct": true,
                    "tipsAndFeedback": {
                      "tip": "",
                      "chosenFeedback": "最多经过对数数量的折半，搜索区间就会缩小至一个元素。",
                      "notChosenFeedback": ""
                    }
                  }
                ]
